              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJehu wayesebabizela ndawonye bonke abantu, wathi kubo: “U-Ahabi wakhonza uBali kancane; kepha uJehu uyakumkhonza kakhulu.",
          "type": "text",
